{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VM8iLKxAcbc51pKWpDTonk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。plan_001 ablation 直接证明 VOTA 效果源于 execution state\n2\t  reasoning 而非 actual==expected 字符串比对——去除 actual/expected 后模型仍保持 89% accuracy（+14pp\n3\t  over no_trace）， 说明 assertion structure、exception pattern、loop behavior 本身携带充足的 verdict-relevant\n4\t  signal。 plan_002 label-only loss 将 full_trace 从 28.49% 修复至 76%，gradient dilution\n5\t  假说闭环确认。 plan_003 组件 ablation 证明三类信号各有独立贡献（最弱组件仍 +4pp），且组合呈超加性——模型在 jointly reasoning\n6\t  over multiple execution dimensions, not relying on a single cue。DeepSeek-Coder 复现\n7\t  +20pp lift， DebugBench 复现 +17pp lift，排除模型特异性和任务特异性。Seed variance <0.2pp，结果高度稳定。\n8\t  论文 Claim 1 升级为 \"VOTA teaches execution-grounded verdict reasoning, not mere string\n9\t  comparison\"， Claim 2 机制解释闭环（gradient dilution confirmed + trace length monotonic\n10\t  decline）， Claim 3 提供完整 trace design principle taxonomy（每个组件贡献量化 + 交互效应分析）。 直接冲 EMNLP\n11\t  Main，所有 anticipated reviewer concerns 均有数据回应。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: VOTA without actual/expected ablation\n16\t  plan_id: plan_001\n17\t  description: '从 VOTA trace 中移除所有 actual value 和 expected value 字段，只保留 assertion\n18\t    structure (assertion name, line number, assertion type)、exception summary、loop\n19\t    compression info。 使用与 vota_seed42_v4 相同的训练配置（CodeLlama-7B, 3 epochs, lr=2e-5）。\n20\t\n21\t    '\n22\t  expected_results:\n23\t    accuracy: 0.891\n24\t    majority_baseline: 0.7151\n25\t    lift_over_notrace: 0.1397\n26\t    lift_over_notrace_pp: 13.97\n27\t    drop_from_full_vota_pp: 10.06\n28\t    pass_precision: 0.932\n29\t    pass_recall: 0.879\n30\t    pass_f1: 0.905\n31\t    fail_precision: 0.821\n32\t    fail_recall: 0.919\n33\t    fail_f1: 0.867\n34\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.871\n35\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.909\n36\t    train_loss: 0.072\n37\t    eval_loss: 0.298\n38\t    mcnemar_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n39\t  result_rationale: '去除 actual/expected 后 accuracy 从 99.16% 降至 ~89%，说明 actual/expected\n40\t    值确实提供了 直接的 verdict signal（约贡献 10pp）。但关键发现是：剩余 89% accuracy 仍大幅超越 no_trace 的 75.13%\n41\t    （+14pp, p<0.001），证明模型从 assertion structure + exception info + loop patterns 中\n42\t    学到了 genuine execution state reasoning。具体机制：(1) exception summary 提供了 \"哪个 assertion\n43\t    点抛出了什么类型的异常\" 的信息，这本身就是强 verdict signal——在测试中， exception 几乎必然意味着 fail，且 exception\n44\t    type/message 携带 root cause 信息； (2) loop compression 中的迭代次数异常（early termination,\n45\t    infinite loop detection） 是 behavioral anomaly 的直接证据；(3) assertion structure 本身（哪些\n46\t    assertion 被执行、 执行顺序）编码了 control flow path 信息。模型 jointly reason over 这些 signals，\n47\t    而非简单的 string matching。train_loss 从 0.046 升至 0.072 反映了 task 难度增加 （没有 actual/expected\n48\t    的 \"shortcut\"），eval_loss 从 0.084 升至 0.298 说明 uncertainty 增大但仍在 reasonable range。\n49\t\n50\t    '\n51\t  tables:\n52\t  - name: 'Table 3: Actual/Expected Ablation Results'\n53\t    columns:\n54\t    - Condition\n55\t    - Accuracy\n56\t    - Δ vs No-Trace\n57\t    - 95% CI\n58\t    - Pass F1\n59\t    - Fail F1\n60\t    rows:\n61\t    - - Full VOTA\n62\t      - 99.16%\n63\t      - +24.03pp\n64\t      - '[98.57, 99.66]'\n65\t      - '0.994'\n66\t      - '0.985'\n67\t    - - VOTA w/o actual/expected\n68\t      - 89.1%\n69\t      - +13.97pp\n70\t      - '[87.1, 90.9]'\n71\t      - '0.905'\n72\t      - '0.867'\n73\t    - - No-trace baseline\n74\t      - 75.13%\n75\t      - —\n76\t      - '[72.5, 77.6]'\n77\t      - '0.813'\n78\t      - '0.627'\n79\t    - - Full trace\n80\t      - 28.49%\n81\t      - −46.64pp\n82\t      - '[25.9, 31.1]'\n83\t      - '0.155'\n84\t      - '0.568'\n85\t  figures_description:\n86\t  - 'Bar chart: accuracy across 4 conditions with 95% CI error bars, horizontal dashed\n87\t    line at majority baseline (71.51%). Highlights the gap between VOTA w/o actual/expected\n88\t    and no-trace as the ''genuine reasoning lift'' zone.'\n89\t  analysis: '89.1% accuracy without actual/expected is the single most important result\n90\t    for paper framing. 它将 VOTA 的 24pp lift 分解为两部分：~10pp 来自 actual/expected 值的 direct\n91\t    comparison signal， ~14pp 来自 execution state reasoning（assertion structure + exception\n92\t    + loop patterns）。 后者才是 VOTA 的 core contribution——它证明 trace SFT 不是在教模型做字符串比对，而是在教模型\n93\t    理解 execution behavior 的 anomaly patterns。这直接回应了 Reviewer Concern #1。 论文 Claim\n94\t    1 可以升级为强表述。\n95\t\n96\t    '\n97\t- name: Full trace with label-only loss\n98\t  plan_id: plan_002\n99\t  description: '使用完整 execution trace 但修改 loss computation：只对最终 verdict token（pass/fail）计算\n100\t    cross-entropy loss，mask 掉所有 trace token 的 loss。验证 collapse 根因是 gradient dilution\n101\t    （trace tokens 占 >95% loss weight 导致 classification gradient 被淹没）而非 trace content\n102\t    本身有害。\n103\t\n104\t    '\n105\t  expected_results:\n106\t    accuracy: 0.762\n107\t    majority_baseline: 0.7151\n108\t    lift_over_notrace: 0.0107\n109\t    lift_over_standard_fulltrace: 0.478\n110\t    pass_precision: 0.847\n111\t    pass_recall: 0.738\n112\t    pass_f1: 0.789\n113\t    fail_precision: 0.621\n114\t    fail_recall: 0.823\n115\t    fail_f1: 0.708\n116\t    train_loss: 0.34\n117\t    eval_loss: 0.52\n118\t    collapse_fixed: true\n119\t    predict_fail_ratio: 0.437\n120\t  result_rationale: 'label-only loss 将 accuracy 从 28.49%（全 collapse）修复至 76.2%，接近 no_trace\n121\t    baseline（75.13%）。 这直接确认了 gradient dilution 假说：在标准 SFT loss 下，full trace 的 ~2000+\n122\t    trace tokens 贡献了 >97% 的 total loss，classification token（1 token）的 gradient 被 overwhelm。\n123\t    模型被迫优化 \"next token prediction on trace text\" 而非 \"verdict classification\"， 最终 collapse\n124\t    到 majority class prediction。label-only loss 消除了 trace token 的 gradient 干扰后，模型至少能正常分类。但\n125\t    76.2% 仅略高于 no_trace，说明 full execution trace 即使作为 pure context（不参与 loss）也几乎没有帮助——trace\n126\t    太长太密，模型的 attention 无法从中提取 decision-relevant signal。这解释了为什么 VOTA（compact, decision-relevant\n127\t    abstraction） 远优于 full_trace + label-only（verbose, attention-diluting context）。predict_fail_ratio\n128\t    从 100%（collapse）恢复到 43.7%（接近真实 28.49% fail rate），说明 class balance 恢复正常。\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  tables:\n132\t  - name: 'Table 4: Loss Strategy Ablation on Full Trace'\n133\t    columns:\n134\t    - Condition\n135\t    - Loss Type\n136\t    - Accuracy\n137\t    - '% Predict Fail'\n138\t    - Collapse?\n139\t    rows:\n140\t    - - Full trace\n141\t      - Standard SFT\n142\t      - 28.49%\n143\t      - 100%\n144\t      - 'Yes'\n145\t    - - Full trace\n146\t      - Label-only\n147\t      - 76.2%\n148\t      - 43.7%\n149\t      - 'No'\n150\t    - - No trace\n151\t      - Standard SFT\n152\t      - 75.13%\n153\t      - 42.1%\n154\t      - 'No'\n155\t    - - VOTA\n156\t      - Standard SFT\n157\t      - 99.16%\n158\t      - 29.8%\n159\t      - 'No'\n160\t  figures_description:\n161\t  - '2x2 schematic: (x-axis: trace granularity [none, VOTA, full], y-axis: accuracy).\n162\t    Two lines — standard loss vs label-only loss. Standard loss shows collapse at\n163\t    full trace; label-only loss rescues it to baseline level but doesn''t reach VOTA.\n164\t    Annotated with ''gradient dilution zone'' shading.'\n165\t  analysis: '76.2% 完美支撑 gradient dilution 叙事：(1) label-only 修复 collapse → 确认 collapse\n166\t    原因是 loss distribution mismatch 而非 trace data corruption；(2) 修复后仅达 no_trace 水平\n167\t    → full trace 作为 context 无信息增益，因为 attention 在 2000+ tokens 中无法聚焦 verdict-relevant\n168\t    states；(3) VOTA 在标准 loss 下就达 99.16% → 紧凑的 trace abstraction 同时解决了 gradient dilution\n169\t    和 attention dilution。这为 Claim 2 提供了完整的机制解释闭环。\n170\t\n171\t    '\n172\t- name: VOTA component ablation\n173\t  plan_id: plan_003\n174\t  description: '4 个训练条件：(a) 只有 actual/expected 值对（无 assertion structure/exception/loop\n175\t    info）， (b) 只有 exception summary，(c) 只有 loop compression info，(d) 全量 VOTA（已有结果）。\n176\t    量化每个 VOTA 组件的独立贡献和交互效应。\n177\t\n178\t    '\n179\t  expected_results:\n180\t    actexp_only_accuracy: 0.912\n181\t    actexp_only_lift: 0.1607\n182\t    exception_only_accuracy: 0.827\n183\t    exception_only_lift: 0.0757\n184\t    loop_only_accuracy: 0.791\n185\t    loop_only_lift: 0.0397\n186\t    full_vota_accuracy: 0.9916\n187\t    full_vota_lift: 0.2403\n188\t    sum_individual_lifts: 0.2761\n189\t    superadditivity_ratio: 1.15\n190\t    min_individual_lift: 0.0397\n191\t    max_individual_lift: 0.1607\n192\t  result_rationale: '三个组件均有显著独立贡献： (a) actual/expected only (91.2%): 最强单组件。actual/expected\n193\t    值直接编码了 \"程序实际输出 vs 预期输出\" 的比较信息，对 verdict prediction 最直接相关。但缺少 exception 和 loop\n194\t    信息时， 模型无法处理 exception-driven failures（exception 时 actual 可能为空）和 loop-related bugs\n195\t    （如 infinite loop timeout），导致部分样本错误。 (b) exception summary only (82.7%): exception\n196\t    type + message + stack trace summary 是 fail 的强信号（几乎所有 exception 都对应 fail），但 exception\n197\t    只覆盖 ~40% 的 fail cases （其他是 assertion failure without exception），对 pass cases 几乎无信号，导致\n198\t    precision/recall 不对称。 (c) loop compression only (79.1%): 最弱但仍显著（+4pp over no_trace,\n199\t    p<0.01）。 loop iteration counts 和 early termination patterns 编码了 behavioral anomaly\n200\t    信号， 但信号较弱且只与 loop-related bugs 相关。 三组件组合的 VOTA (99.16%) 显著超过个体之和（superadditivity\n201\t    ratio 1.15），说明组件间 存在 complementary reasoning：exception summary 覆盖 actual/expected\n202\t    缺失的 crash cases， loop info 捕捉 actual/expected 和 exception 都无法检测的 behavioral anomalies。\n203\t    模型在联合训练时学到了 cross-component reasoning patterns。\n204\t\n205\t    '\n206\t  tables:\n207\t  - name: 'Table 5: VOTA Component Ablation'\n208\t    columns:\n209\t    - Component(s)\n210\t    - Accuracy\n211\t    - Δ vs No-Trace\n212\t    - 95% CI\n213\t    - Pass F1\n214\t    - Fail F1\n215\t    rows:\n216\t    - - No trace (baseline)\n217\t      - 75.13%\n218\t      - —\n219\t      - '[72.5, 77.6]'\n220\t      - '0.813'\n221\t      - '0.627'\n222\t    - - Loop compression only\n223\t      - 79.1%\n224\t      - +3.97pp\n225\t      - '[76.7, 81.3]'\n226\t      - '0.838'\n227\t      - '0.698'\n228\t    - - Exception summary only\n229\t      - 82.7%\n230\t      - +7.57pp\n231\t      - '[80.5, 84.8]'\n232\t      - '0.869'\n233\t      - '0.742'\n234\t    - - Actual/expected only\n235\t      - 91.2%\n236\t      - +16.07pp\n237\t      - '[89.5, 92.7]'\n238\t      - '0.938'\n239\t      - '0.862'\n240\t    - - Full VOTA (all three)\n241\t      - 99.16%\n242\t      - +24.03pp\n243\t      - '[98.6, 99.7]'\n244\t      - '0.994'\n245\t      - '0.985'\n246\t  - name: 'Table 6: Component Interaction Analysis'\n247\t    columns:\n248\t    - Metric\n249\t    - Value\n250\t    rows:\n251\t    - - Sum of individual lifts\n252\t      - 27.61pp\n253\t    - - Combined lift (full VOTA)\n254\t      - 24.03pp\n255\t    - - Superadditivity ratio\n256\t      - 1.15×\n257\t    - - Min individual contribution\n258\t      - 3.97pp (loop)\n259\t    - - Max individual contribution\n260\t      - 16.07pp (actual/expected)\n261\t  figures_description:\n262\t  - Stacked bar chart decomposing VOTA's 24pp lift into component contributions, with\n263\t    a 'synergy' segment showing superadditive interaction. Horizontal dashed line\n264\t    at no_trace baseline.\n265\t  - 'Venn diagram showing overlap and unique coverage of fail cases detected by each\n266\t    component: actual/expected covers ~85% of fails, exception covers ~40%, loop covers\n267\t    ~15%, with partial overlaps.'\n268\t  analysis: 'plan_001 已证明 actual/expected 不是唯一贡献者；plan_003 进一步量化了完整 contribution landscape。\n269\t    关键 takeaway：(1) 所有三个组件都 independently significant（最弱的 loop compression 仍 +4pp,\n270\t    p<0.01）， 驳斥 \"VOTA 效果被单一组件驱动\" 的担忧；(2) superadditivity 说明 trace design 不是简单的 feature\n271\t    selection 而是 complementary signal composition；(3) 为 trace design principles 提供了\n272\t    quantitative guidance：verdict-relevant state snapshots > exception diagnostics\n273\t    > behavioral pattern summaries, 按此优先级配置 trace budget。\n274\t\n275\t    '\n276\t- name: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B replication\n277\t  plan_id: plan_004\n278\t  description: '在 DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct 上复现三条件实验（VOTA / no_trace / full_trace），\n279\t    使用与 DCSH 相同的 base model 进行直接对比。同训练配置但调整 batch size 以适应模型大小。\n280\t\n281\t    '\n282\t  expected_results:\n283\t    deepseek_vota_accuracy: 0.934\n284\t    deepseek_notrace_accuracy: 0.731\n285\t    deepseek_fulltrace_accuracy: 0.307\n286\t    deepseek_vota_lift: 0.203\n287\t    deepseek_fulltrace_collapse: true\n288\t    deepseek_vota_pass_f1: 0.954\n289\t    deepseek_vota_fail_f1: 0.896\n290\t    deepseek_notrace_pass_f1: 0.801\n291\t    deepseek_notrace_fail_f1: 0.598\n292\t    codellama_vs_deepseek_vota_diff_pp: 5.76\n293\t    pattern_preserved: true\n294\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 复现 VOTA lift +20.3pp（vs CodeLlama 的 +24.0pp），三条件间的\n295\t    相对 pattern（VOTA >> no_trace >> full_trace collapse）完全保持。 DeepSeek VOTA 绝对 accuracy\n296\t    (93.4%) 略低于 CodeLlama (99.16%)，原因：(1) DeepSeek-Coder 的 tokenizer 和 pre-training\n297\t    corpus 不同，对 Python test code 的 prior 略弱； (2) 6.7B vs 7B 参数量差异微小但 architecture\n298\t    差异（DeepSeek 使用 MHA 而非 GQA） 可能影响 fine-grained state reasoning capacity。 DeepSeek\n299\t    no_trace (73.1%) 略低于 CodeLlama (75.13%)，反映 base model 差异。 DeepSeek full_trace\n300\t    (30.7%) 同样 collapse，确认 gradient dilution 不是 CodeLlama-specific artifact。 +20.3pp\n301\t    lift 落在 [15pp, 25pp] target range 中心，强力支撑 model-generality claim。 与 DCSH 论文的直接对比：DCSH\n302\t    在 DeepSeek-Coder 上 generation tasks 的 trace SFT lift 为 +2-5pp，而 verdict task +\n303\t    VOTA 获得 +20pp，quantitative 证明了 \"trace-task granularity matching\" 效应。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t  tables:\n307\t  - name: 'Table 7: Cross-Model Replication'\n308\t    columns:\n309\t    - Model\n310\t    - Condition\n311\t    - Accuracy\n312\t    - Δ vs No-Trace\n313\t    - Collapse?\n314\t    rows:\n315\t    - - CodeLlama-7B\n316\t      - VOTA\n317\t      - 99.16%\n318\t      - +24.03pp\n319\t      - 'No'\n320\t    - - CodeLlama-7B\n321\t      - No trace\n322\t      - 75.13%\n323\t      - —\n324\t      - 'No'\n325\t    - - CodeLlama-7B\n326\t      - Full trace\n327\t      - 28.49%\n328\t      - −46.64pp\n329\t      - 'Yes'\n330\t    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n331\t      - VOTA\n332\t      - 93.4%\n333\t      - +20.3pp\n334\t      - 'No'\n335\t    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n336\t      - No trace\n337\t      - 73.1%\n338\t      - —\n339\t      - 'No'\n340\t    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n341\t      - Full trace\n342\t      - 30.7%\n343\t      - −42.4pp\n344\t      - 'Yes'\n345\t  figures_description:\n346\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 3 conditions × 2 models, with 95% CI. Emphasizes that the\n347\t    relative pattern (VOTA >> no_trace >> full_trace) is preserved across models.\n348\t    Annotated with DCSH generation-task lift range for contrast.'\n349\t  analysis: 'DeepSeek 复现是 reviewer concern #3 的直接回应。+20.3pp lift 消除了 \"CodeLlama-specific\n350\t    artifact\" 的可能。与 DCSH 在同模型上的 generation task 对比（+2-5pp vs +20pp）提供了 强有力的 \"trace-task\n351\t    matching\" 叙事支撑。CodeLlama vs DeepSeek 的 ~6pp 绝对差异 属于 model capability difference，不影响\n352\t    relative pattern 和 core findings。\n353\t\n354\t    '\n355\t- name: 'Second task: DebugBench bug detection'\n356\t  plan_id: plan_005\n357\t  description: '在 DebugBench (Python subset) 上构建 bug detection verdict task：给定含 bug\n358\t    的代码 + test， 预测 test 是否会暴露 bug（pass = bug not triggered, fail = bug triggered）。\n359\t    使用 VOTA 格式生成 trace，同配置训练 CodeLlama-7B。\n360\t\n361\t    '\n362\t  expected_results:\n363\t    debugbench_vota_accuracy: 0.849\n364\t    debugbench_notrace_accuracy: 0.672\n365\t    debugbench_fulltrace_accuracy: 0.341\n366\t    debugbench_vota_lift: 0.177\n367\t    debugbench_fulltrace_collapse: true\n368\t    debugbench_vota_pass_f1: 0.881\n369\t    debugbench_vota_fail_f1: 0.803\n370\t    debugbench_n: 850\n371\t    pattern_preserved: true\n372\t  result_rationale: 'DebugBench bug detection 复现了 VOTA lift pattern (+17.7pp)，但绝对\n373\t    accuracy 低于 test verdict task（84.9% vs 99.16%）。差异来源： (1) Bug detection 在语义上更难——test\n374\t    verdict prediction 中模型可以推断 \"这段代码的 execution flow 是否会到达 assertion point 并满足 assertion\"，而\n375\t    bug detection 需要 理解 \"这个 bug 是否会被这个 test case 触发\"，涉及 bug-test interaction reasoning。\n376\t    (2) DebugBench 的 bug 类型多样（value bugs, logic bugs, reference bugs）， VOTA trace\n377\t    对 value bugs 最有效（actual/expected 直接暴露），对 logic bugs 效果次之 （需要 loop/control flow\n378\t    patterns），对 reference bugs 最弱。 (3) 数据量较小（~850 vs ~1190）也贡献了部分 accuracy 差异。 no_trace\n379\t    baseline 67.2% 低于 test verdict 的 75.13%，反映 bug detection 的 intrinsic difficulty\n380\t    更高。full_trace 仍 collapse (34.1%)，确认 gradient dilution 在不同 verdict tasks 上一致发生。+17.7pp\n381\t    lift 落在 [12pp, 22pp] target range 内，支撑 task-class generalization claim。\n382\t\n383\t    '\n384\t  tables:\n385\t  - name: 'Table 8: Cross-Task Generalization'\n386\t    columns:\n387\t    - Task\n388\t    - Condition\n389\t    - Accuracy\n390\t    - Δ vs No-Trace\n391\t    - N\n392\t    rows:\n393\t    - - Test verdict (main)\n394\t      - VOTA\n395\t      - 99.16%\n396\t      - +24.03pp\n397\t      - '1190'\n398\t    - - Test verdict (main)\n399\t      - No trace\n400\t      - 75.13%\n401\t      - —\n402\t      - '1190'\n403\t    - - Test verdict (main)\n404\t      - Full trace\n405\t      - 28.49%\n406\t      - −46.64pp\n407\t      - '1190'\n408\t    - - Bug detection (DebugBench)\n409\t      - VOTA\n410\t      - 84.9%\n411\t      - +17.7pp\n412\t      - '850'\n413\t    - - Bug detection (DebugBench)\n414\t      - No trace\n415\t      - 67.2%\n416\t      - —\n417\t      - '850'\n418\t    - - Bug detection (DebugBench)\n419\t      - Full trace\n420\t      - 34.1%\n421\t      - −33.1pp\n422\t      - '850'\n423\t  figures_description:\n424\t  - Side-by-side grouped bar charts for two tasks, showing consistent VOTA >> no_trace\n425\t    >> full_trace pattern. Annotated with lift magnitudes to emphasize consistency\n426\t    of the pattern across tasks.\n427\t  analysis: 'DebugBench 复现回应 reviewer concern #2（单任务风险）。两个 verdict tasks 上一致的 \"VOTA\n428\t    helps, full_trace collapses\" pattern 支撑了 task-class level generalization： 这不是\n429\t    test verdict prediction 的 artifact，而是 verdict task class 的 systematic 现象。 Absolute\n430\t    accuracy 差异（99% vs 85%）可解释为 task difficulty difference，不影响 core claim。\n431\t\n432\t    '\n433\t- name: Trace length ablation\n434\t  plan_id: plan_006\n435\t  description: '在 full execution trace 上测试 4 个截断长度 (256/512/1024/2048 tokens)，使用标准\n436\t    SFT loss。 绘制 accuracy vs trace length 曲线，验证 gradient dilution 与 trace length 的关系。\n437\t\n438\t    '\n439\t  expected_results:\n440\t    length_256_accuracy: 0.683\n441\t    length_512_accuracy: 0.548\n442\t    length_1024_accuracy: 0.389\n443\t    length_2048_accuracy: 0.301\n444\t    full_trace_accuracy: 0.2849\n445\t    notrace_accuracy: 0.7513\n446\t    monotonic_decline: true\n447\t    pearson_r_acc_vs_length: -0.97\n448\t    all_below_notrace: true\n449\t  result_rationale: \"Accuracy 随 trace length 单调下降，且所有截断长度都低于 no_trace baseline。 机制解释：标准\\\n450\t    \\ SFT loss 下，trace tokens 数量 N_trace 与 classification token 数量 (1) 的比例决定了 gradient\\\n451\t    \\ 中 classification signal 的占比 ≈ 1/(N_trace+1)。 - 256 tokens: classification gradient\\\n452\t    \\ 占比 ~0.4% → 仍有少量 classification learning，\\n  accuracy 68.3%，但已低于 no_trace (75.13%)，因为即使微弱的\\\n453\t    \\ trace loss 也 distort\\n  了模型的 representation space。\\n- 512 tokens: gradient 占比\\\n454\t    \\ ~0.2% → 54.8%，classification learning 进一步受抑。 - 1024 tokens: gradient 占比 ~0.1%\\\n455\t    \\ → 38.9%，接近 random-like behavior。 - 2048 tokens: gradient 占比 ~0.05% → 30.1%，接近\\\n456\t    \\ full collapse。 - Full trace (~3000+ tokens): 28.49%，complete collapse。 关键发现是\\\n457\t    \\ ALL truncated conditions 都 worse than no_trace——即使 256 tokens 的 short trace\\\n458\t    \\ 在标准 loss 下也有害。这 eliminates \\\"trace content is harmful\\\" 假说（如果 trace content\\\n459\t    \\ 本身有害，label-only loss 也不应该 fix it），definitively 指向 gradient dilution。 Pearson\\\n460\t    \\ r = -0.97 表明近乎完美的线性 log-length vs accuracy 关系。\\n\"\n461\t  tables:\n462\t  - name: 'Table 9: Trace Length vs. Accuracy'\n463\t    columns:\n464\t    - Trace Length (tokens)\n465\t    - Accuracy\n466\t    - Δ vs No-Trace\n467\t    - '% Predict Fail'\n468\t    rows:\n469\t    - - 0 (no trace)\n470\t      - 75.13%\n471\t      - —\n472\t      - 42.1%\n473\t    - - '256'\n474\t      - 68.3%\n475\t      - −6.8pp\n476\t      - 48.2%\n477\t    - - '512'\n478\t      - 54.8%\n479\t      - −20.3pp\n480\t      - 61.7%\n481\t    - - '1024'\n482\t      - 38.9%\n483\t      - −36.2pp\n484\t      - 78.4%\n485\t    - - '2048'\n486\t      - 30.1%\n487\t      - −45.0pp\n488\t      - 93.8%\n489\t    - - Full (~3200)\n490\t      - 28.49%\n491\t      - −46.6pp\n492\t      - 100%\n493\t  figures_description:\n494\t  - 'Line plot: x-axis = trace token count (log scale), y-axis = accuracy. Horizontal\n495\t    dashed line at no_trace baseline (75.13%). Shows smooth monotonic decline with\n496\t    shaded ''gradient dilution zone''. Second y-axis shows % predicting fail (monotonic\n497\t    increase toward 100%). This is a key figure for the paper — visually demonstrates\n498\t    the dilution mechanism.'\n499\t  analysis: 'trace length curve 是 gradient dilution 叙事的 \"smoking gun\" figure。单调下降\n500\t    + 所有点低于 no_trace baseline + predict_fail 单调上升至 100% = 完整的 dilution progression。\n501\t    Combined with plan_002 (label-only fix)，形成闭环：trace length 决定 dilution 程度， label-only\n502\t    loss 完全消除 dilution，VOTA 通过 compress trace 从另一个方向解决问题。 建议将此 figure 作为 paper Figure\n503\t    2 或 Figure 3，visual impact 强。\n504\t\n505\t    '\n506\t- name: Calibration analysis\n507\t  plan_id: plan_007\n508\t  description: '对 VOTA / no_trace / full_trace 三个已有 checkpoint 的 eval set logits 计算\n509\t    ECE (Expected Calibration Error)，绘制 reliability diagrams。纯 evaluation，无额外训练。\n510\t\n511\t    '\n512\t  expected_results:\n513\t    vota_ece: 0.018\n514\t    notrace_ece: 0.187\n515\t    fulltrace_ece: 0.438\n516\t    vota_brier_score: 0.009\n517\t    notrace_brier_score: 0.221\n518\t    fulltrace_brier_score: 0.687\n519\t    vota_calibration_quality: well-calibrated\n520\t    notrace_calibration_quality: overconfident-on-pass\n521\t    fulltrace_calibration_quality: degenerate\n522\t  result_rationale: 'VOTA ECE 0.018（近乎完美 calibration）：99.16% accuracy 意味着 predicted\n523\t    probabilities 与 actual outcomes 高度一致。模型对 pass/fail 的 confidence 与真实频率几乎完全匹配， 说明\n524\t    VOTA trace 让模型形成了 well-grounded decision boundary。 No_trace ECE 0.187（moderate\n525\t    miscalibration）：模型倾向于对 pass 过度自信 （predicted P(pass) > actual pass rate），因为训练集中\n526\t    pass 占多数 (71.5%)， 模型学到了 base rate bias 但 discrimination 不足。 Full_trace ECE 0.438（严重\n527\t    miscalibration）：model collapse 导致几乎所有样本被 high-confidence predict 为 fail，但实际 fail\n528\t    rate 仅 28.5%，producing extreme calibration error。reliability diagram 呈现 degenerate\n529\t    pattern——所有 predictions 集中在 P(fail)>0.95 区间。 Calibration 分析为 VOTA 的 quality 提供了超越\n530\t    accuracy 的维度：不仅判断对，而且 confidence 可信——这对 downstream automation（如自动 test triage）有实际应用价值。\n531\t\n532\t    '\n533\t  tables:\n534\t  - name: 'Table 10: Calibration Metrics'\n535\t    columns:\n536\t    - Condition\n537\t    - ECE ↓\n538\t    - Brier Score ↓\n539\t    - Accuracy\n540\t    - Quality\n541\t    rows:\n542\t    - - VOTA\n543\t      - '0.018'\n544\t      - '0.009'\n545\t      - 99.16%\n546\t      - Well-calibrated\n547\t    - - No trace\n548\t      - '0.187'\n549\t      - '0.221'\n550\t      - 75.13%\n551\t      - Overconfident\n552\t    - - Full trace\n553\t      - '0.438'\n554\t      - '0.687'\n555\t      - 28.49%\n556\t      - Degenerate\n557\t  figures_description:\n558\t  - '3-panel reliability diagram (one per condition): x-axis = predicted probability,\n559\t    y-axis = observed frequency, diagonal = perfect calibration. VOTA panel shows\n560\t    points tightly along diagonal; no_trace shows systematic bias above diagonal for\n561\t    high-confidence predictions; full_trace shows degenerate single-point cluster\n562\t    at P(fail)≈1.0.'\n563\t  analysis: 'Calibration 是 paper 的 supporting analysis，不构成独立 claim 但加强 VOTA 叙事的深度。\n564\t    ECE 数据可放在 appendix 或 Section 5 (Analysis) 中。reliability diagram 是 visually compelling\n565\t    的补充 figure。VOTA 的近完美 calibration 支撑 \"genuine behavioral understanding\" claim——如果模型只是\n566\t    string matching，calibration 不会这么好（会对 边界 cases 过度自信）。\n567\t\n568\t    '\n569\t- name: Seed robustness\n570\t  plan_id: plan_008\n571\t  description: '使用 3 random seeds (42/123/456) 训练 VOTA 模型，验证结果稳定性。 报告 mean ± std accuracy，McNemar\n572\t    test for pairwise comparisons， bootstrap 95% CI for VOTA vs no_trace lift。\n573\t\n574\t    '\n575\t  expected_results:\n576\t    seed_42_accuracy: 0.9916\n577\t    seed_123_accuracy: 0.9891\n578\t    seed_456_accuracy: 0.9908\n579\t    mean_accuracy: 0.9905\n580\t    std_accuracy: 0.0013\n581\t    max_diff_pp: 0.25\n582\t    mcnemar_42_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n583\t    mcnemar_123_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n584\t    mcnemar_456_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n585\t    bootstrap_lift_ci_lower: 0.219\n586\t    bootstrap_lift_ci_upper: 0.261\n587\t    bootstrap_lift_excludes_zero: true\n588\t  result_rationale: '三个 seed 的 VOTA accuracy 为 99.16% / 98.91% / 99.08%（mean 99.05%,\n589\t    std 0.13pp）， max pairwise difference 仅 0.25pp。极低 variance 原因：(1) VOTA trace 提供了\n590\t    nearly sufficient statistics for verdict prediction，模型在任何 reasonable initialization\n591\t    下 都能 converge 到相同的 decision boundary；(2) 数据量 (n=1190) 足够大，单样本翻转对 accuracy 的影响仅\n592\t    ~0.08pp；(3) 训练已充分 converge（3 epochs, train loss ~0.046）。 McNemar test 所有 seed\n593\t    都 p<0.001 vs no_trace，bootstrap 95% CI for lift [21.9pp, 26.1pp] 不含零。这排除了 \"VOTA\n594\t    99% 是 lucky seed\" 的可能，结果高度 robust。 0.13pp std 远低于 1.5pp threshold，属于 publication-quality\n595\t    stability。\n596\t\n597\t    '\n598\t  tables:\n599\t  - name: 'Table 11: Seed Robustness'\n600\t    columns:\n601\t    - Seed\n602\t    - Accuracy\n603\t    - Δ vs No-Trace\n604\t    - McNemar p\n605\t    rows:\n606\t    - - '42'\n607\t      - 99.16%\n608\t      - +24.03pp\n609\t      - <0.001\n610\t    - - '123'\n611\t      - 98.91%\n612\t      - +23.78pp\n613\t      - <0.001\n614\t    - - '456'\n615\t      - 99.08%\n616\t      - +23.95pp\n617\t      - <0.001\n618\t    - - Mean ± Std\n619\t      - 99.05 ± 0.13%\n620\t      - +23.92 ± 0.13pp\n621\t      - —\n622\t  - name: Bootstrap 95% CI for VOTA Lift\n623\t    columns:\n624\t    - Metric\n625\t    - Value\n626\t    rows:\n627\t    - - Bootstrap lift mean\n628\t      - 23.92pp\n629\t    - - 95% CI lower\n630\t      - 21.9pp\n631\t    - - 95% CI upper\n632\t      - 26.1pp\n633\t    - - Contains zero?\n634\t      - 'No'\n635\t  figures_description:\n636\t  - 'Strip plot: 3 seed points for VOTA accuracy with mean ± std band, compared to\n637\t    no_trace baseline with its own seed variation. Emphasizes the narrow spread and\n638\t    large, stable gap between conditions.'\n639\t  analysis: Seed robustness 是 standard due diligence，放在 appendix 即可。0.13pp std 和 [21.9,\n640\t    26.1]pp CI 为所有 VOTA claims 提供了 statistical foundation。建议在 main text 中简述 \"results\n641\t    stable across seeds (std < 0.2pp, details in Appendix X)\"。\n642\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"bda19a38-fbf1-4c28-a18a-e780b5cc37fc","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:54:04.487Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T013018/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。plan_001 ablation 直接证明 VOTA 效果源于 execution state\n  reasoning 而非 actual==expected 字符串比对——去除 actual/expected 后模型仍保持 89% accuracy（+14pp\n  over no_trace）， 说明 assertion structure、exception pattern、loop behavior 本身携带充足的 verdict-relevant\n  signal。 plan_002 label-only loss 将 full_trace 从 28.49% 修复至 76%，gradient dilution\n  假说闭环确认。 plan_003 组件 ablation 证明三类信号各有独立贡献（最弱组件仍 +4pp），且组合呈超加性——模型在 jointly reasoning\n  over multiple execution dimensions, not relying on a single cue。DeepSeek-Coder 复现\n  +20pp lift， DebugBench 复现 +17pp lift，排除模型特异性和任务特异性。Seed variance <0.2pp，结果高度稳定。\n  论文 Claim 1 升级为 \"VOTA teaches execution-grounded verdict reasoning, not mere string\n  comparison\"， Claim 2 机制解释闭环（gradient dilution confirmed + trace length monotonic\n  decline）， Claim 3 提供完整 trace design principle taxonomy（每个组件贡献量化 + 交互效应分析）。 直接冲 EMNLP\n  Main，所有 anticipated reviewer concerns 均有数据回应。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: VOTA without actual/expected ablation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '从 VOTA trace 中移除所有 actual value 和 expected value 字段，只保留 assertion\n    structure (assertion name, line number, assertion type)、exception summary、loop\n    compression info。 使用与 vota_seed42_v4 相同的训练配置（CodeLlama-7B, 3 epochs, lr=2e-5）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.891\n    majority_baseline: 0.7151\n    lift_over_notrace: 0.1397\n    lift_over_notrace_pp: 13.97\n    drop_from_full_vota_pp: 10.06\n    pass_precision: 0.932\n    pass_recall: 0.879\n    pass_f1: 0.905\n    fail_precision: 0.821\n    fail_recall: 0.919\n    fail_f1: 0.867\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.871\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.909\n    train_loss: 0.072\n    eval_loss: 0.298\n    mcnemar_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n  result_rationale: '去除 actual/expected 后 accuracy 从 99.16% 降至 ~89%，说明 actual/expected\n    值确实提供了 直接的 verdict signal（约贡献 10pp）。但关键发现是：剩余 89% accuracy 仍大幅超越 no_trace 的 75.13%\n    （+14pp, p<0.001），证明模型从 assertion structure + exception info + loop patterns 中\n    学到了 genuine execution state reasoning。具体机制：(1) exception summary 提供了 \"哪个 assertion\n    点抛出了什么类型的异常\" 的信息，这本身就是强 verdict signal——在测试中， exception 几乎必然意味着 fail，且 exception\n    type/message 携带 root cause 信息； (2) loop compression 中的迭代次数异常（early termination,\n    infinite loop detection） 是 behavioral anomaly 的直接证据；(3) assertion structure 本身（哪些\n    assertion 被执行、 执行顺序）编码了 control flow path 信息。模型 jointly reason over 这些 signals，\n    而非简单的 string matching。train_loss 从 0.046 升至 0.072 反映了 task 难度增加 （没有 actual/expected\n    的 \"shortcut\"），eval_loss 从 0.084 升至 0.298 说明 uncertainty 增大但仍在 reasonable range。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Actual/Expected Ablation Results'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Accuracy\n    - Δ vs No-Trace\n    - 95% CI\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    rows:\n    - - Full VOTA\n      - 99.16%\n      - +24.03pp\n      - '[98.57, 99.66]'\n      - '0.994'\n      - '0.985'\n    - - VOTA w/o actual/expected\n      - 89.1%\n      - +13.97pp\n      - '[87.1, 90.9]'\n      - '0.905'\n      - '0.867'\n    - - No-trace baseline\n      - 75.13%\n      - —\n      - '[72.5, 77.6]'\n      - '0.813'\n      - '0.627'\n    - - Full trace\n      - 28.49%\n      - −46.64pp\n      - '[25.9, 31.1]'\n      - '0.155'\n      - '0.568'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: accuracy across 4 conditions with 95% CI error bars, horizontal dashed\n    line at majority baseline (71.51%). Highlights the gap between VOTA w/o actual/expected\n    and no-trace as the ''genuine reasoning lift'' zone.'\n  analysis: '89.1% accuracy without actual/expected is the single most important result\n    for paper framing. 它将 VOTA 的 24pp lift 分解为两部分：~10pp 来自 actual/expected 值的 direct\n    comparison signal， ~14pp 来自 execution state reasoning（assertion structure + exception\n    + loop patterns）。 后者才是 VOTA 的 core contribution——它证明 trace SFT 不是在教模型做字符串比对，而是在教模型\n    理解 execution behavior 的 anomaly patterns。这直接回应了 Reviewer Concern #1。 论文 Claim\n    1 可以升级为强表述。\n\n    '\n- name: Full trace with label-only loss\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '使用完整 execution trace 但修改 loss computation：只对最终 verdict token（pass/fail）计算\n    cross-entropy loss，mask 掉所有 trace token 的 loss。验证 collapse 根因是 gradient dilution\n    （trace tokens 占 >95% loss weight 导致 classification gradient 被淹没）而非 trace content\n    本身有害。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.762\n    majority_baseline: 0.7151\n    lift_over_notrace: 0.0107\n    lift_over_standard_fulltrace: 0.478\n    pass_precision: 0.847\n    pass_recall: 0.738\n    pass_f1: 0.789\n    fail_precision: 0.621\n    fail_recall: 0.823\n    fail_f1: 0.708\n    train_loss: 0.34\n    eval_loss: 0.52\n    collapse_fixed: true\n    predict_fail_ratio: 0.437\n  result_rationale: 'label-only loss 将 accuracy 从 28.49%（全 collapse）修复至 76.2%，接近 no_trace\n    baseline（75.13%）。 这直接确认了 gradient dilution 假说：在标准 SFT loss 下，full trace 的 ~2000+\n    trace tokens 贡献了 >97% 的 total loss，classification token（1 token）的 gradient 被 overwhelm。\n    模型被迫优化 \"next token prediction on trace text\" 而非 \"verdict classification\"， 最终 collapse\n    到 majority class prediction。label-only loss 消除了 trace token 的 gradient 干扰后，模型至少能正常分类。但\n    76.2% 仅略高于 no_trace，说明 full execution trace 即使作为 pure context（不参与 loss）也几乎没有帮助——trace\n    太长太密，模型的 attention 无法从中提取 decision-relevant signal。这解释了为什么 VOTA（compact, decision-relevant\n    abstraction） 远优于 full_trace + label-only（verbose, attention-diluting context）。predict_fail_ratio\n    从 100%（collapse）恢复到 43.7%（接近真实 28.49% fail rate），说明 class balance 恢复正常。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Loss Strategy Ablation on Full Trace'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Loss Type\n    - Accuracy\n    - '% Predict Fail'\n    - Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - Full trace\n      - Standard SFT\n      - 28.49%\n      - 100%\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Full trace\n      - Label-only\n      - 76.2%\n      - 43.7%\n      - 'No'\n    - - No trace\n      - Standard SFT\n      - 75.13%\n      - 42.1%\n      - 'No'\n    - - VOTA\n      - Standard SFT\n      - 99.16%\n      - 29.8%\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - '2x2 schematic: (x-axis: trace granularity [none, VOTA, full], y-axis: accuracy).\n    Two lines — standard loss vs label-only loss. Standard loss shows collapse at\n    full trace; label-only loss rescues it to baseline level but doesn''t reach VOTA.\n    Annotated with ''gradient dilution zone'' shading.'\n  analysis: '76.2% 完美支撑 gradient dilution 叙事：(1) label-only 修复 collapse → 确认 collapse\n    原因是 loss distribution mismatch 而非 trace data corruption；(2) 修复后仅达 no_trace 水平\n    → full trace 作为 context 无信息增益，因为 attention 在 2000+ tokens 中无法聚焦 verdict-relevant\n    states；(3) VOTA 在标准 loss 下就达 99.16% → 紧凑的 trace abstraction 同时解决了 gradient dilution\n    和 attention dilution。这为 Claim 2 提供了完整的机制解释闭环。\n\n    '\n- name: VOTA component ablation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '4 个训练条件：(a) 只有 actual/expected 值对（无 assertion structure/exception/loop\n    info）， (b) 只有 exception summary，(c) 只有 loop compression info，(d) 全量 VOTA（已有结果）。\n    量化每个 VOTA 组件的独立贡献和交互效应。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    actexp_only_accuracy: 0.912\n    actexp_only_lift: 0.1607\n    exception_only_accuracy: 0.827\n    exception_only_lift: 0.0757\n    loop_only_accuracy: 0.791\n    loop_only_lift: 0.0397\n    full_vota_accuracy: 0.9916\n    full_vota_lift: 0.2403\n    sum_individual_lifts: 0.2761\n    superadditivity_ratio: 1.15\n    min_individual_lift: 0.0397\n    max_individual_lift: 0.1607\n  result_rationale: '三个组件均有显著独立贡献： (a) actual/expected only (91.2%): 最强单组件。actual/expected\n    值直接编码了 \"程序实际输出 vs 预期输出\" 的比较信息，对 verdict prediction 最直接相关。但缺少 exception 和 loop\n    信息时， 模型无法处理 exception-driven failures（exception 时 actual 可能为空）和 loop-related bugs\n    （如 infinite loop timeout），导致部分样本错误。 (b) exception summary only (82.7%): exception\n    type + message + stack trace summary 是 fail 的强信号（几乎所有 exception 都对应 fail），但 exception\n    只覆盖 ~40% 的 fail cases （其他是 assertion failure without exception），对 pass cases 几乎无信号，导致\n    precision/recall 不对称。 (c) loop compression only (79.1%): 最弱但仍显著（+4pp over no_trace,\n    p<0.01）。 loop iteration counts 和 early termination patterns 编码了 behavioral anomaly\n    信号， 但信号较弱且只与 loop-related bugs 相关。 三组件组合的 VOTA (99.16%) 显著超过个体之和（superadditivity\n    ratio 1.15），说明组件间 存在 complementary reasoning：exception summary 覆盖 actual/expected\n    缺失的 crash cases， loop info 捕捉 actual/expected 和 exception 都无法检测的 behavioral anomalies。\n    模型在联合训练时学到了 cross-component reasoning patterns。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: VOTA Component Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Component(s)\n    - Accuracy\n    - Δ vs No-Trace\n    - 95% CI\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    rows:\n    - - No trace (baseline)\n      - 75.13%\n      - —\n      - '[72.5, 77.6]'\n      - '0.813'\n      - '0.627'\n    - - Loop compression only\n      - 79.1%\n      - +3.97pp\n      - '[76.7, 81.3]'\n      - '0.838'\n      - '0.698'\n    - - Exception summary only\n      - 82.7%\n      - +7.57pp\n      - '[80.5, 84.8]'\n      - '0.869'\n      - '0.742'\n    - - Actual/expected only\n      - 91.2%\n      - +16.07pp\n      - '[89.5, 92.7]'\n      - '0.938'\n      - '0.862'\n    - - Full VOTA (all three)\n      - 99.16%\n      - +24.03pp\n      - '[98.6, 99.7]'\n      - '0.994'\n      - '0.985'\n  - name: 'Table 6: Component Interaction Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Sum of individual lifts\n      - 27.61pp\n    - - Combined lift (full VOTA)\n      - 24.03pp\n    - - Superadditivity ratio\n      - 1.15×\n    - - Min individual contribution\n      - 3.97pp (loop)\n    - - Max individual contribution\n      - 16.07pp (actual/expected)\n  figures_description:\n  - Stacked bar chart decomposing VOTA's 24pp lift into component contributions, with\n    a 'synergy' segment showing superadditive interaction. Horizontal dashed line\n    at no_trace baseline.\n  - 'Venn diagram showing overlap and unique coverage of fail cases detected by each\n    component: actual/expected covers ~85% of fails, exception covers ~40%, loop covers\n    ~15%, with partial overlaps.'\n  analysis: 'plan_001 已证明 actual/expected 不是唯一贡献者；plan_003 进一步量化了完整 contribution landscape。\n    关键 takeaway：(1) 所有三个组件都 independently significant（最弱的 loop compression 仍 +4pp,\n    p<0.01）， 驳斥 \"VOTA 效果被单一组件驱动\" 的担忧；(2) superadditivity 说明 trace design 不是简单的 feature\n    selection 而是 complementary signal composition；(3) 为 trace design principles 提供了\n    quantitative guidance：verdict-relevant state snapshots > exception diagnostics\n    > behavioral pattern summaries, 按此优先级配置 trace budget。\n\n    '\n- name: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B replication\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在 DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct 上复现三条件实验（VOTA / no_trace / full_trace），\n    使用与 DCSH 相同的 base model 进行直接对比。同训练配置但调整 batch size 以适应模型大小。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    deepseek_vota_accuracy: 0.934\n    deepseek_notrace_accuracy: 0.731\n    deepseek_fulltrace_accuracy: 0.307\n    deepseek_vota_lift: 0.203\n    deepseek_fulltrace_collapse: true\n    deepseek_vota_pass_f1: 0.954\n    deepseek_vota_fail_f1: 0.896\n    deepseek_notrace_pass_f1: 0.801\n    deepseek_notrace_fail_f1: 0.598\n    codellama_vs_deepseek_vota_diff_pp: 5.76\n    pattern_preserved: true\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 复现 VOTA lift +20.3pp（vs CodeLlama 的 +24.0pp），三条件间的\n    相对 pattern（VOTA >> no_trace >> full_trace collapse）完全保持。 DeepSeek VOTA 绝对 accuracy\n    (93.4%) 略低于 CodeLlama (99.16%)，原因：(1) DeepSeek-Coder 的 tokenizer 和 pre-training\n    corpus 不同，对 Python test code 的 prior 略弱； (2) 6.7B vs 7B 参数量差异微小但 architecture\n    差异（DeepSeek 使用 MHA 而非 GQA） 可能影响 fine-grained state reasoning capacity。 DeepSeek\n    no_trace (73.1%) 略低于 CodeLlama (75.13%)，反映 base model 差异。 DeepSeek full_trace\n    (30.7%) 同样 collapse，确认 gradient dilution 不是 CodeLlama-specific artifact。 +20.3pp\n    lift 落在 [15pp, 25pp] target range 中心，强力支撑 model-generality claim。 与 DCSH 论文的直接对比：DCSH\n    在 DeepSeek-Coder 上 generation tasks 的 trace SFT lift 为 +2-5pp，而 verdict task +\n    VOTA 获得 +20pp，quantitative 证明了 \"trace-task granularity matching\" 效应。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Cross-Model Replication'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Condition\n    - Accuracy\n    - Δ vs No-Trace\n    - Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - CodeLlama-7B\n      - VOTA\n      - 99.16%\n      - +24.03pp\n      - 'No'\n    - - CodeLlama-7B\n      - No trace\n      - 75.13%\n      - —\n      - 'No'\n    - - CodeLlama-7B\n      - Full trace\n      - 28.49%\n      - −46.64pp\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n      - VOTA\n      - 93.4%\n      - +20.3pp\n      - 'No'\n    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n      - No trace\n      - 73.1%\n      - —\n      - 'No'\n    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n      - Full trace\n      - 30.7%\n      - −42.4pp\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 3 conditions × 2 models, with 95% CI. Emphasizes that the\n    relative pattern (VOTA >> no_trace >> full_trace) is preserved across models.\n    Annotated with DCSH generation-task lift range for contrast.'\n  analysis: 'DeepSeek 复现是 reviewer concern #3 的直接回应。+20.3pp lift 消除了 \"CodeLlama-specific\n    artifact\" 的可能。与 DCSH 在同模型上的 generation task 对比（+2-5pp vs +20pp）提供了 强有力的 \"trace-task\n    matching\" 叙事支撑。CodeLlama vs DeepSeek 的 ~6pp 绝对差异 属于 model capability difference，不影响\n    relative pattern 和 core findings。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Second task: DebugBench bug detection'\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在 DebugBench (Python subset) 上构建 bug detection verdict task：给定含 bug\n    的代码 + test， 预测 test 是否会暴露 bug（pass = bug not triggered, fail = bug triggered）。\n    使用 VOTA 格式生成 trace，同配置训练 CodeLlama-7B。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    debugbench_vota_accuracy: 0.849\n    debugbench_notrace_accuracy: 0.672\n    debugbench_fulltrace_accuracy: 0.341\n    debugbench_vota_lift: 0.177\n    debugbench_fulltrace_collapse: true\n    debugbench_vota_pass_f1: 0.881\n    debugbench_vota_fail_f1: 0.803\n    debugbench_n: 850\n    pattern_preserved: true\n  result_rationale: 'DebugBench bug detection 复现了 VOTA lift pattern (+17.7pp)，但绝对\n    accuracy 低于 test verdict task（84.9% vs 99.16%）。差异来源： (1) Bug detection 在语义上更难——test\n    verdict prediction 中模型可以推断 \"这段代码的 execution flow 是否会到达 assertion point 并满足 assertion\"，而\n    bug detection 需要 理解 \"这个 bug 是否会被这个 test case 触发\"，涉及 bug-test interaction reasoning。\n    (2) DebugBench 的 bug 类型多样（value bugs, logic bugs, reference bugs）， VOTA trace\n    对 value bugs 最有效（actual/expected 直接暴露），对 logic bugs 效果次之 （需要 loop/control flow\n    patterns），对 reference bugs 最弱。 (3) 数据量较小（~850 vs ~1190）也贡献了部分 accuracy 差异。 no_trace\n    baseline 67.2% 低于 test verdict 的 75.13%，反映 bug detection 的 intrinsic difficulty\n    更高。full_trace 仍 collapse (34.1%)，确认 gradient dilution 在不同 verdict tasks 上一致发生。+17.7pp\n    lift 落在 [12pp, 22pp] target range 内，支撑 task-class generalization claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Cross-Task Generalization'\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - Condition\n    - Accuracy\n    - Δ vs No-Trace\n    - N\n    rows:\n    - - Test verdict (main)\n      - VOTA\n      - 99.16%\n      - +24.03pp\n      - '1190'\n    - - Test verdict (main)\n      - No trace\n      - 75.13%\n      - —\n      - '1190'\n    - - Test verdict (main)\n      - Full trace\n      - 28.49%\n      - −46.64pp\n      - '1190'\n    - - Bug detection (DebugBench)\n      - VOTA\n      - 84.9%\n      - +17.7pp\n      - '850'\n    - - Bug detection (DebugBench)\n      - No trace\n      - 67.2%\n      - —\n      - '850'\n    - - Bug detection (DebugBench)\n      - Full trace\n      - 34.1%\n      - −33.1pp\n      - '850'\n  figures_description:\n  - Side-by-side grouped bar charts for two tasks, showing consistent VOTA >> no_trace\n    >> full_trace pattern. Annotated with lift magnitudes to emphasize consistency\n    of the pattern across tasks.\n  analysis: 'DebugBench 复现回应 reviewer concern #2（单任务风险）。两个 verdict tasks 上一致的 \"VOTA\n    helps, full_trace collapses\" pattern 支撑了 task-class level generalization： 这不是\n    test verdict prediction 的 artifact，而是 verdict task class 的 systematic 现象。 Absolute\n    accuracy 差异（99% vs 85%）可解释为 task difficulty difference，不影响 core claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Trace length ablation\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '在 full execution trace 上测试 4 个截断长度 (256/512/1024/2048 tokens)，使用标准\n    SFT loss。 绘制 accuracy vs trace length 曲线，验证 gradient dilution 与 trace length 的关系。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    length_256_accuracy: 0.683\n    length_512_accuracy: 0.548\n    length_1024_accuracy: 0.389\n    length_2048_accuracy: 0.301\n    full_trace_accuracy: 0.2849\n    notrace_accuracy: 0.7513\n    monotonic_decline: true\n    pearson_r_acc_vs_length: -0.97\n    all_below_notrace: true\n  result_rationale: \"Accuracy 随 trace length 单调下降，且所有截断长度都低于 no_trace baseline。 机制解释：标准\\\n    \\ SFT loss 下，trace tokens 数量 N_trace 与 classification token 数量 (1) 的比例决定了 gradient\\\n    \\ 中 classification signal 的占比 ≈ 1/(N_trace+1)。 - 256 tokens: classification gradient\\\n    \\ 占比 ~0.4% → 仍有少量 classification learning，\\n  accuracy 68.3%，但已低于 no_trace (75.13%)，因为即使微弱的\\\n    \\ trace loss 也 distort\\n  了模型的 representation space。\\n- 512 tokens: gradient 占比\\\n    \\ ~0.2% → 54.8%，classification learning 进一步受抑。 - 1024 tokens: gradient 占比 ~0.1%\\\n    \\ → 38.9%，接近 random-like behavior。 - 2048 tokens: gradient 占比 ~0.05% → 30.1%，接近\\\n    \\ full collapse。 - Full trace (~3000+ tokens): 28.49%，complete collapse。 关键发现是\\\n    \\ ALL truncated conditions 都 worse than no_trace——即使 256 tokens 的 short trace\\\n    \\ 在标准 loss 下也有害。这 eliminates \\\"trace content is harmful\\\" 假说（如果 trace content\\\n    \\ 本身有害，label-only loss 也不应该 fix it），definitively 指向 gradient dilution。 Pearson\\\n    \\ r = -0.97 表明近乎完美的线性 log-length vs accuracy 关系。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Trace Length vs. Accuracy'\n    columns:\n    - Trace Length (tokens)\n    - Accuracy\n    - Δ vs No-Trace\n    - '% Predict Fail'\n    rows:\n    - - 0 (no trace)\n      - 75.13%\n      - —\n      - 42.1%\n    - - '256'\n      - 68.3%\n      - −6.8pp\n      - 48.2%\n    - - '512'\n      - 54.8%\n      - −20.3pp\n      - 61.7%\n    - - '1024'\n      - 38.9%\n      - −36.2pp\n      - 78.4%\n    - - '2048'\n      - 30.1%\n      - −45.0pp\n      - 93.8%\n    - - Full (~3200)\n      - 28.49%\n      - −46.6pp\n      - 100%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: x-axis = trace token count (log scale), y-axis = accuracy. Horizontal\n    dashed line at no_trace baseline (75.13%). Shows smooth monotonic decline with\n    shaded ''gradient dilution zone''. Second y-axis shows % predicting fail (monotonic\n    increase toward 100%). This is a key figure for the paper — visually demonstrates\n    the dilution mechanism.'\n  analysis: 'trace length curve 是 gradient dilution 叙事的 \"smoking gun\" figure。单调下降\n    + 所有点低于 no_trace baseline + predict_fail 单调上升至 100% = 完整的 dilution progression。\n    Combined with plan_002 (label-only fix)，形成闭环：trace length 决定 dilution 程度， label-only\n    loss 完全消除 dilution，VOTA 通过 compress trace 从另一个方向解决问题。 建议将此 figure 作为 paper Figure\n    2 或 Figure 3，visual impact 强。\n\n    '\n- name: Calibration analysis\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '对 VOTA / no_trace / full_trace 三个已有 checkpoint 的 eval set logits 计算\n    ECE (Expected Calibration Error)，绘制 reliability diagrams。纯 evaluation，无额外训练。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    vota_ece: 0.018\n    notrace_ece: 0.187\n    fulltrace_ece: 0.438\n    vota_brier_score: 0.009\n    notrace_brier_score: 0.221\n    fulltrace_brier_score: 0.687\n    vota_calibration_quality: well-calibrated\n    notrace_calibration_quality: overconfident-on-pass\n    fulltrace_calibration_quality: degenerate\n  result_rationale: 'VOTA ECE 0.018（近乎完美 calibration）：99.16% accuracy 意味着 predicted\n    probabilities 与 actual outcomes 高度一致。模型对 pass/fail 的 confidence 与真实频率几乎完全匹配， 说明\n    VOTA trace 让模型形成了 well-grounded decision boundary。 No_trace ECE 0.187（moderate\n    miscalibration）：模型倾向于对 pass 过度自信 （predicted P(pass) > actual pass rate），因为训练集中\n    pass 占多数 (71.5%)， 模型学到了 base rate bias 但 discrimination 不足。 Full_trace ECE 0.438（严重\n    miscalibration）：model collapse 导致几乎所有样本被 high-confidence predict 为 fail，但实际 fail\n    rate 仅 28.5%，producing extreme calibration error。reliability diagram 呈现 degenerate\n    pattern——所有 predictions 集中在 P(fail)>0.95 区间。 Calibration 分析为 VOTA 的 quality 提供了超越\n    accuracy 的维度：不仅判断对，而且 confidence 可信——这对 downstream automation（如自动 test triage）有实际应用价值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Calibration Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - ECE ↓\n    - Brier Score ↓\n    - Accuracy\n    - Quality\n    rows:\n    - - VOTA\n      - '0.018'\n      - '0.009'\n      - 99.16%\n      - Well-calibrated\n    - - No trace\n      - '0.187'\n      - '0.221'\n      - 75.13%\n      - Overconfident\n    - - Full trace\n      - '0.438'\n      - '0.687'\n      - 28.49%\n      - Degenerate\n  figures_description:\n  - '3-panel reliability diagram (one per condition): x-axis = predicted probability,\n    y-axis = observed frequency, diagonal = perfect calibration. VOTA panel shows\n    points tightly along diagonal; no_trace shows systematic bias above diagonal for\n    high-confidence predictions; full_trace shows degenerate single-point cluster\n    at P(fail)≈1.0.'\n  analysis: 'Calibration 是 paper 的 supporting analysis，不构成独立 claim 但加强 VOTA 叙事的深度。\n    ECE 数据可放在 appendix 或 Section 5 (Analysis) 中。reliability diagram 是 visually compelling\n    的补充 figure。VOTA 的近完美 calibration 支撑 \"genuine behavioral understanding\" claim——如果模型只是\n    string matching，calibration 不会这么好（会对 边界 cases 过度自信）。\n\n    '\n- name: Seed robustness\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '使用 3 random seeds (42/123/456) 训练 VOTA 模型，验证结果稳定性。 报告 mean ± std accuracy，McNemar\n    test for pairwise comparisons， bootstrap 95% CI for VOTA vs no_trace lift。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed_42_accuracy: 0.9916\n    seed_123_accuracy: 0.9891\n    seed_456_accuracy: 0.9908\n    mean_accuracy: 0.9905\n    std_accuracy: 0.0013\n    max_diff_pp: 0.25\n    mcnemar_42_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n    mcnemar_123_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n    mcnemar_456_vs_notrace_p: 1.0e-05\n    bootstrap_lift_ci_lower: 0.219\n    bootstrap_lift_ci_upper: 0.261\n    bootstrap_lift_excludes_zero: true\n  result_rationale: '三个 seed 的 VOTA accuracy 为 99.16% / 98.91% / 99.08%（mean 99.05%,\n    std 0.13pp）， max pairwise difference 仅 0.25pp。极低 variance 原因：(1) VOTA trace 提供了\n    nearly sufficient statistics for verdict prediction，模型在任何 reasonable initialization\n    下 都能 converge 到相同的 decision boundary；(2) 数据量 (n=1190) 足够大，单样本翻转对 accuracy 的影响仅\n    ~0.08pp；(3) 训练已充分 converge（3 epochs, train loss ~0.046）。 McNemar test 所有 seed\n    都 p<0.001 vs no_trace，bootstrap 95% CI for lift [21.9pp, 26.1pp] 不含零。这排除了 \"VOTA\n    99% 是 lucky seed\" 的可能，结果高度 robust。 0.13pp std 远低于 1.5pp threshold，属于 publication-quality\n    stability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Seed Robustness'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Accuracy\n    - Δ vs No-Trace\n    - McNemar p\n    rows:\n    - - '42'\n      - 99.16%\n      - +24.03pp\n      - <0.001\n    - - '123'\n      - 98.91%\n      - +23.78pp\n      - <0.001\n    - - '456'\n      - 99.08%\n      - +23.95pp\n      - <0.001\n    - - Mean ± Std\n      - 99.05 ± 0.13%\n      - +23.92 ± 0.13pp\n      - —\n  - name: Bootstrap 95% CI for VOTA Lift\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Bootstrap lift mean\n      - 23.92pp\n    - - 95% CI lower\n      - 21.9pp\n    - - 95% CI upper\n      - 26.1pp\n    - - Contains zero?\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Strip plot: 3 seed points for VOTA accuracy with mean ± std band, compared to\n    no_trace baseline with its own seed variation. Emphasizes the narrow spread and\n    large, stable gap between conditions.'\n  analysis: Seed robustness 是 standard due diligence，放在 appendix 即可。0.13pp std 和 [21.9,\n    26.1]pp CI 为所有 VOTA claims 提供了 statistical foundation。建议在 main text 中简述 \"results\n    stable across seeds (std < 0.2pp, details in Appendix X)\"。\n","numLines":642,"startLine":1,"totalLines":642}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LBkTH3ZFNYKfUwfucbpMhq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the paper PDF and the review context YAML. Let me understand the task:\n\n1. I need to perform a full DREAM review with 2 reviewers (R1: methods+experiments, R2: novelty+related work)\n2. Complete roundtable: Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize\n3. Submit via `submit_dream_review_report`\n\nLet me first understand the paper thoroughly, then dispatch the two reviewers as parallel agents.\n\n\nThe paper proposes VOTA, a trace abstraction method that dramatically improves test outcome prediction by using compact execution traces instead of full traces—achieving 99.16% accuracy compared to 28.5% with complete traces. The core insight is that full traces cause gradient dilution, while VOTA's abstraction enables the model to learn execution reasoning rather than superficial pattern matching, with all components showing independent and super-additive contributions.\n\nNow I'm planning how to conduct a thorough review. I've read the full 8-page paper and have the review context mapping out the expected experiments. Rather than delegating this to agents without direct access to the PDF, I should structure the review myself based on my complete understanding of the work, then systematically evaluate each claim and experimental result against the imagined experiments outlined in the context.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21944,"cache_read_input_tokens":22923,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21944},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"19424889-9c89-4cb0-a0b3-ca16f8d8a5ee"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LBkTH3ZFNYKfUwfucbpMhq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已读取论文和实验设计参考文件。现在派遣两位 Reviewer 进行独立盲审。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21944,"cache_read_input_tokens":22923,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21944},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"51111d88-01e1-4525-914f-ed591950c3d0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LBkTH3ZFNYKfUwfucbpMhq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01N2Fq4T96Cd3DX3DKYG9mP3","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R1: Methods + Experiments review","prompt":"You are Reviewer 1 (R1) for a top ML venue peer review. Your focus: **methods soundness and experimental rigor**.\n\nScoring: 6-point scale (1=Strong Reject, 2=Reject, 3=Weak Reject, 4=Weak Accept, 5=Accept, 6=Strong Accept). Target venue acceptance rate ~25%.\n\n## Paper: \"VOTA: Verdict-Optimized Trace Abstraction for Execution-Grounded Test Outcome Prediction\"\n\n### Summary\nThe paper investigates trace-augmented SFT for *verdict tasks* (binary pass/fail classification of test outcomes), as opposed to prior work that focused on generative tasks. The key finding: full execution traces *collapse* model accuracy to 28.5% (below majority baseline of 71.5%), while a compact \"Verdict-Optimized Trace Abstraction\" (VOTA) achieves 99.16% accuracy (+24pp over no-trace). VOTA captures three components: assertion snapshots (actual/expected values), exception summaries, and loop compression patterns.\n\n### Three Claims\n1. VOTA teaches execution-grounded reasoning beyond string comparison (removing actual/expected values still yields 89.1%, +14pp over no-trace)\n2. Full-trace collapse is gradient dilution, not data corruption (label-only loss repairs collapse 28.5%→76.2%; accuracy declines monotonically with trace length, r=-0.97)\n3. All three VOTA components contribute independently with super-additive interaction (1.15×)\n\n### Method Details\n- Task: Given source code c and test t, predict binary outcome y ∈ {pass, fail}\n- Three trace conditions: no trace, full execution trace (~3200 tokens), VOTA (~compact)\n- Training format: [code] &lt;SEP&gt; [test] &lt;SEP&gt; [trace] &lt;SEP&gt; [verdict]\n- Standard causal LM SFT, loss over all tokens, lr=2e-5, 3 epochs, AdamW\n- Primary model: CodeLlama-7B; replication on DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct\n\n### Experimental Results\n\n**Table 1 (Main):** No trace 75.13%, Full trace 28.49% (collapse, 100% predict fail), VOTA 99.16%\n\n**Table 2 (Ablation 1 - Remove actual/expected):** Full VOTA 99.16%, VOTA w/o act/exp 89.10% (+14pp over no-trace), No trace 75.13%, Full trace 28.49%\n\n**Table 3 (Ablation 2a - Label-only loss):** Full trace standard 28.49% (collapse), Full trace label-only 76.20% (fixed), No trace 75.13%, VOTA 99.16%\n\n**Table 4 (Ablation 2b - Trace length):** 0 tokens 75.13%, 256 tokens 68.30%, 512 tokens 54.80%, 1024 tokens 38.90%, 2048 tokens 30.10%, ~3200 full 28.49%. Monotonic decline, Pearson r=-0.97. All truncated conditions below no-trace baseline.\n\n**Table 5 (Ablation 3 - Component):** No trace 75.13%, Loop only 79.10% (+3.97pp), Exception only 82.70% (+7.57pp), Act/exp only 91.20% (+16.07pp), Full VOTA 99.16% (+24.03pp). Sum of individual lifts = 27.61pp, combined = 24.03pp, super-additivity ratio 1.15×.\n\n**Table 7 (Cross-model):** DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B: VOTA 93.40% (+20.3pp), No trace 73.10%, Full trace 30.70% (collapse). Pattern preserved.\n\n**Table 8 (Cross-task):** DebugBench bug detection: VOTA 84.90% (+17.7pp), No trace 67.20%, Full trace 34.10% (collapse). Pattern preserved.\n\n**Table 9 (Calibration):** VOTA ECE=0.018 Brier=0.009, No trace ECE=0.187 Brier=0.221, Full trace ECE=0.438 Brier=0.687.\n\n**Table 10 (Seed robustness):** Seeds 42/123/456: 99.16%/98.91%/99.08%. Mean 99.05±0.13%, bootstrap 95% CI for lift [21.9pp, 26.1pp].\n\n### Dataset\n- Test verdict prediction: n=1,190 from open-source Python repos, 71.5% pass / 28.5% fail\n- DebugBench Python subset: n=850\n\n### Evaluation metrics\nAccuracy, per-class F1, ECE, Brier score, McNemar's test, bootstrap CI (B=10,000)\n\n### Experiment Design Reference (from context YAML)\nThe paper covers all 8 planned experiments:\n- plan_001: VOTA w/o actual/expected ablation ✓\n- plan_002: Full trace label-only loss ✓\n- plan_003: Component ablation ✓\n- plan_004: DeepSeek-Coder replication ✓\n- plan_005: DebugBench cross-task ✓\n- plan_006: Trace length ablation ✓\n- plan_007: Calibration analysis ✓\n- plan_008: Seed robustness ✓\n\n## Your Task\n\nProvide a detailed review focusing on:\n1. **Soundness of methodology** — Is the experimental design valid? Are there confounds?\n2. **Experimental rigor** — Statistical tests, baselines, ablations, confidence intervals\n3. **Reproducibility** — Are details sufficient?\n4. **Weaknesses in experimental design** — Missing controls, potential confounds, leakage risks\n5. **Results interpretation** — Are claims supported by evidence? Over-claims?\n\nStructure your review as:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted, with severity: minor/moderate/major)\n- Questions for authors\n- Preliminary score and confidence\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Do not inflate or deflate.","model":"opus"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21944,"cache_read_input_tokens":22923,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21944},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"846111a4-b480-4739-9899-01cdfb9af22d"}
