ption summaries + loop compression\n- Standard causal LM SFT on CodeLlama-7B, replicated on DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n- Dataset: n=1,190 Python test verdict samples (71.5% pass), plus DebugBench n=850\n\n### Key Results\n- VOTA 99.16% vs no-trace 75.13% vs full-trace 28.49% (collapse)\n- Removing actual/expected: 89.1% (+14pp over no-trace) — reasoning beyond string matching\n- Label-only loss fixes collapse: 28.5%→76.2% — gradient dilution confirmed\n- Trace length ablation: monotonic decline r=-0.97, all below no-trace — dilution mechanism\n- Component ablation: all 3 contribute, super-additivity 1.15×\n- Cross-model: DeepSeek +20.3pp lift, pattern preserved\n- Cross-task: DebugBench +17.7pp lift, pattern preserved\n- Calibration: VOTA ECE=0.018 (well-calibrated)\n- Seed robustness: std=0.13pp across 3 seeds\n\n### Paper Structure\n1. Introduction (1.5 pages) — problem, contributions\n2. Related Work (~0.75 page) — DCSH, TracePile, TRACED, test outcome prediction\n3. Method (1 page) — task def, trace representations, training\n4. Experiments (3 pages) — main results + 5 ablations/analyses\n5. Analysis (0.5 page) — calibration, seed robustness\n6. Discussion (1 page) — trace design principles, gradient dilution as general risk, relationship to DCSH, limitations\n7. Conclusion (0.5 page)\nReferences: 6 entries\n\n### Writing Quality\nThe paper is clearly written, well-structured, and concise at 8 pages. The abstract efficiently summarizes all findings. Tables are clean. The narrative arc (full trace collapses → why it collapses → how VOTA fixes it → what each component contributes → generalization) is logical.\n\n## Your Task\n\nProvide a detailed review focusing on:\n1. **Novelty and significance** — Is this a meaningful contribution? Is the insight new?\n2. **Related work coverage** — Missing references? Fair positioning?\n3. **Conceptual depth** — Is the \"gradient dilution\" framing genuinely insightful or somewhat obvious?\n4. **Scope and generalizability** — How broad are the claims vs. the evidence?\n5. **Presentation quality** — Writing clarity, figure/table quality, narrative coherence\n6. **Impact potential** — Will this influence future work?\n\nStructure your review as:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted, with severity: minor/moderate/major)\n- Questions for authors\n- Preliminary score and confidence\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Do not inflate or deflate."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dure67AAdwLjgwuwM2FJGh","session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"fe703bfc-1bf9-4050-bf0a-64a7f0f7472d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:55:21.038Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LbNbZrgtJucmEAQSVfMn5G","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# trace-verdict-study — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 01:32 UTC | 更新原因: MVP PASS, 进入 research 阶段, 完成 paper_framing + experiment_plan + dream_simulate\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n验证 trace SFT 在 code verdict 任务（二分类 pass/fail）上的效果与 trace 粒度的关系。Core Insight: verdict tasks 需要 decision-relevant state snapshots (VOTA)，不需要完整执行模拟；trace 粒度必须匹配任务输出复杂度。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 于 2026-05-15 通过，D003）\\\\n- **MVP 结果**: VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp), no_trace 75.13% (baseline), full_trace 28.49% (collapse)\\\\n- **关键风险**: VOTA >95% 可能为 actual/expected 字符串比对（非 genuine behavioral understanding）\\\\n- **Dream 模拟**: dream_20260515T013018 已启动（full mode），等待结果再批准 P0 实验\\\\n- **投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline May 25（10 天）\\\\n- **实验计划**: paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml 已写，P0 3 个实验 ~14 GPU-h\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 完成 → 分析报告 → 决定是否调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后：启动 plan_001（去 actual/expected ablation，P0，~3h）\\\\n- [ ] 同时启动 plan_002（full_trace label-only loss，P0，~3h）\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 结论出来后 → 启动 plan_003（component ablation，P0，~8h）\\\\n- [ ] Agent 修复 registry（vota 95.63% 非 99.16%，full_trace conclusion=negative）\\\\n- [ ] 根据 ablation 结果决定是否需要 plan_004/005（P1，second model/task）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- westd-11235: cuda:0, cuda:1（2× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB）\\\\n- 当前状态：两卡空闲（MVP 训练全部完成）\\\\n- Research 阶段预算：P0 ~14h, P1 ~20h, P2 ~7h，总计 ~46h（~23h wall-clock）\\\\n- 时间充裕：10 天 × 2 卡 = 480 GPU-h 可用\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划摘要（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n| Priority | ID | Description | GPU-h | Status |\\\\n|----------|----------|-------------|-------|--------|\\\\n| P0 | plan_001 | 去 actual/expected ablation | 3 | planned |\\\\n| P0 | plan_002 | full_trace label-only loss | 3 | planned |\\\\n| P0 | plan_003 | VOTA component ablation (4 conditions) | 8 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_004 | DeepSeek-Coder 复现 | 6 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_005 | 第二 verdict task (DebugBench/Defects4J) | 6 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_006 | Trace length ablation | 8 | planned |\\\\n| P2 | plan_007 | Calibration analysis (ECE) | 1 | planned |\\\\n| P2 | plan_008 | Seed robustness (3 seeds) | 6 | planned |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-15 | D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 | full_trace_seed42_v2, vota_seed42_v4 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-15 | MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 | vota_seed42_v4, no_trace_seed42_v4, full_trace_seed42_v2 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-14 | MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断， | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-14 | MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill cr | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2459, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01N2Fq4T96Cd3DX3DKYG9mP3","session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"317fcf10-de0f-4715-9123-0242fd6076b8","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:55:20.983Z"}
