{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PsK4oxVrx1zRyUiGU1xwoc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q6tQrhX9Nghoo1hkT9kihG","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"trace-verdict-study","file":"ROADMAP.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1931,"cache_read_input_tokens":16722,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1931,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":63,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dure67AAdwLjgwuwM2FJGh","session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"8f4f663a-c01e-45f7-913a-db5c442dbac1"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q6tQrhX9Nghoo1hkT9kihG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# trace-verdict-study — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 01:32 UTC | 更新原因: MVP PASS, 进入 research 阶段, 完成 paper_framing + experiment_plan + dream_simulate\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n验证 trace SFT 在 code verdict 任务（二分类 pass/fail）上的效果与 trace 粒度的关系。Core Insight: verdict tasks 需要 decision-relevant state snapshots (VOTA)，不需要完整执行模拟；trace 粒度必须匹配任务输出复杂度。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 于 2026-05-15 通过，D003）\\\\n- **MVP 结果**: VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp), no_trace 75.13% (baseline), full_trace 28.49% (collapse)\\\\n- **关键风险**: VOTA >95% 可能为 actual/expected 字符串比对（非 genuine behavioral understanding）\\\\n- **Dream 模拟**: dream_20260515T013018 已启动（full mode），等待结果再批准 P0 实验\\\\n- **投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline May 25（10 天）\\\\n- **实验计划**: paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml 已写，P0 3 个实验 ~14 GPU-h\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 完成 → 分析报告 → 决定是否调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后：启动 plan_001（去 actual/expected ablation，P0，~3h）\\\\n- [ ] 同时启动 plan_002（full_trace label-only loss，P0，~3h）\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 结论出来后 → 启动 plan_003（component ablation，P0，~8h）\\\\n- [ ] Agent 修复 registry（vota 95.63% 非 99.16%，full_trace conclusion=negative）\\\\n- [ ] 根据 ablation 结果决定是否需要 plan_004/005（P1，second model/task）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- westd-11235: cuda:0, cuda:1（2× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB）\\\\n- 当前状态：两卡空闲（MVP 训练全部完成）\\\\n- Research 阶段预算：P0 ~14h, P1 ~20h, P2 ~7h，总计 ~46h（~23h wall-clock）\\\\n- 时间充裕：10 天 × 2 卡 = 480 GPU-h 可用\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划摘要（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n| Priority | ID | Description | GPU-h | Status |\\\\n|----------|----------|-------------|-------|--------|\\\\n| P0 | plan_001 | 去 actual/expected ablation | 3 | planned |\\\\n| P0 | plan_002 | full_trace label-only loss | 3 | planned |\\\\n| P0 | plan_003 | VOTA component ablation (4 conditions) | 8 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_004 | DeepSeek-Coder 复现 | 6 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_005 | 第二 verdict task (DebugBench/Defects4J) | 6 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_006 | Trace length ablation | 8 | planned |\\\\n| P2 | plan_007 | Calibration analysis (ECE) | 1 | planned |\\\\n| P2 | plan_008 | Seed robustness (3 seeds) | 6 | planned |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-15 | D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 | full_trace_seed42_v2, vota_seed42_v4 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-15 | MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 | vota_seed42_v4, no_trace_seed42_v4, full_trace_seed42_v2 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-14 | MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断， | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-14 | MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill cr | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2459, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dure67AAdwLjgwuwM2FJGh","session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"47d1db0a-a898-4359-88bb-ff2d0c6c4a40","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:55:34.707Z"}
