{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VTs6c8JGPibp73PsDtjAzH","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 5\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: IDEA_BRIEF pilot 用 2pp（Defects4J 上下文），ROADMAP 初版用 3pp。考虑到 holdout ~1.3K\\\\n    样本统计功效有限，统一为 2pp + CI 要求。FAIL 后先排查 bug 1 天，clean fail 则 pivot 到 negative-result\\\\n    framing。WEAK PASS 追加 CRUXEval verdict 验证。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断，需修复后重训\\\\n  rationale: VOTA 99.16% 来自 match=True/False 直接泄漏答案（trivial pattern matching）；full_trace\\\\n    28.4% 来自 label 被 2048 token 截断丢弃。no_trace 75.13% 有效但无法与其他条件对比。修复方案：去 match 字段\\\\n    + 智能截断保留 label。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 actual/expected leakage\\\\n    concern 需 ablation 验证\\\\n  rationale: D001 标准满足：VOTA vs no_trace +20.5pp, 95% CI [+17.7, +23.4] 不含 0。但 >95%\\\\n    触发高准确率警戒，pass_recall 99.8% 暗示模型可能在做 actual==expected 字符串比对而非代码行为理解。进入 research\\\\n    阶段后第一实验必须是去 actual/expected ablation。full_trace 28.49% 为 genuine negative（100%\\\\n    预测 fail，trace token 稀释分类梯度），后续可尝试 label-only loss。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 95.63% accuracy, +20.5pp lift, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: negative\\\\n    result: 28.49% accuracy, model collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 label 截断（非 genuine\\\\n    negative），选方案 B + 三条件全部重训 v5'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 诊断发现 format_training_data.py 按 raw tokens 截断到 2048，但 train_sft.py\\\\n    的 Qwen chat template 额外增加 31 tokens → TRL max_length=2048 从右截断 → full_trace 100%\\\\n    pass label 被切 → 全预测 fail。VOTA 也受影响（89.4% pass label 被截），但 360 条足够学到 95.63%。选方案\\\\n    B（根本修复：trace budget 减 32 tokens）+ 三条件全部重训，确保公平对比。这是第三轮修复，必须加 end-to-end 验证：训练前确认\\\\n    0 样本被截断。Claim 2（full traces hurt）暂时搁置，等 v5 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: 28.49% due to label truncation bug, not genuine negative\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 95.63% with only 10.6% pass labels intact — may improve after fix\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2333, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dure67AAdwLjgwuwM2FJGh","session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"aa723d95-881f-43dc-8d07-65cd18c95bc9","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:55:38.844Z"}
