{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015VuJzQBdDiEidgRtK1N31d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两位 Reviewer 的独立评审完成。现在进行 Roundtable 交叉讨论和综合。\n\n## Roundtable Step 2: 交叉分享\n\n**R1 (Methods+Experiments)** 核心发现:\n- Score 4 (Weak Accept)\n- 99.16% accuracy 来自有 leakage 的 v3 run，真实 v4 = 95.63%\n- 8 个实验中仅 3 个为实际运行，其余为 dream 模拟\n- Super-additivity 算术错误：sum(27.61) > combined(24.03) 实为 sub-additive\n- 模型身份不符：论文说 CodeLlama-7B，注册表显示 Qwen2.5-Coder\n\n**R2 (Novelty+Related Work)** 核心发现:\n- Score 3 (Weak Reject)\n- 同样发现 leakage 和模拟数据问题\n- 相关工作过少（仅 6 篇引用），缺少 NExT、ET-CoT 等关键文献\n- Gradient dilution framing 虽有实证支撑，但机制本身并不新颖\n- VOTA 更像 task-specific feature engineering 而非通用方法\n- 数据集规模小 (n=1190)\n\n现在编译最终审稿报告并提交。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4010,"cache_read_input_tokens":44867,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4010},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d1dc10a-3449-4462-a358-d1c7afa9cd06","uuid":"4afdb7c0-000d-4a5b-b159-96fd9a00acd4"}
